    "description": "<p>You whisper a discordant melody that only the creature you choose can hear.</p><p>Choose a thinking creature within <strong>10 spaces</strong>. It must make an opposed <strong>Willpower</strong> check or take <strong>1 Damag</strong>e and be <strong>Frightened </strong>until the start of your next turn. This <strong>Damage</strong> ignores <strong>Armor</strong>.</p><p>Each extra success extends the duration by <strong>+1 rounds</strong>.</p><p>Alternatively, you may increase the <strong>Damage</strong> by <strong>+1</strong> per extra success.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.iOXfbq9JfLNzS70c]{Dissonant Whispers}</p>",
